  documentId: DOC_NEWS_2
  documentType: 0
  title: "At\u0131\u011F\u0131 azalt; hasad\u0131 ve k\u0131y\u0131y\u0131 birlikte
    koru"
  body: "Meyveler bug\xFCn denetim kapsam\u0131na a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor. K\xFCf ve
    renk kayb\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir; \xE7evresel kal\u0131nt\u0131lar laboratuvar
    analiziyle saptan\u0131r. Meyvelere, daha \xF6nce a\xE7\u0131lan et ve s\xFCt
    \xFCr\xFCnleri de e\u015Flik ediyor.\n\nReddedilen g\u0131dan\u0131n ambalaj\u0131n\u0131
    do\u011Fru hedefe g\xF6nderin. At\u0131\u011F\u0131n k\u0131y\u0131ya ula\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131
    \xF6nlemek, caretta carettalar\u0131n ya\u015Fam alanlar\u0131n\u0131 korur.
    Temiz g\xF6r\xFCnen bir \xFCr\xFCn\xFCn analizini de kontrol edin."
  taskInstructionBox: "YEN\u0130 GRUP / MEYVELER"
